### Purchases, suppliers and both return registers. Owner / Manager, except GET /returns/sales.
### The server computes every split; a client only previews it.

@base = https://hisbah-api-alur.onrender.com/api/v1
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### The purchases register: newest first, local dates in the store timezone.
GET {{base}}/purchases?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-01&supplier_id=7&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One invoice with its lines (quantity and returned_quantity in pieces or kg) and its returns.
GET {{base}}/purchases/12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Goods back to the supplier. The value lowers the supplier's balance first (balance_reduction);
### what is left comes back from the supplier (refund_amount). from_stock false: the goods are
### already off the shelf (a customer returned them damaged), so the stock does not move.
### 422 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK when the shelf holds less than what is going back.
POST {{base}}/purchases/12/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 6f1d2c3e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "purchase_item_id": 21, "quantity": "24", "from_stock": true }],
  "reason": "بضاعة تالفة"
}

### Goods back from a customer: a line marked damaged is valued like the rest but stays off the shelf.
POST {{base}}/sales/40/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 6f1d2c3e-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "invoice_item_id": 9, "quantity": "1", "damaged": true }],
  "reason": "علبة مفتوحة"
}

### The return registers.
GET {{base}}/returns/sales?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/returns/purchases?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-01&supplier_id=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sales by kind. on_credit = credit + partial, as the dashboard's credit figure counts them.
GET {{base}}/sales?type=on_credit&status=active&source=sale&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
